Table: ActorDirector

+-------------+---------+
| Column Name | Type    |
+-------------+---------+
| actor_id    | int     |
| director_id | int     |
| timestamp   | int     |
+-------------+---------+
timestamp is the primary key (column with unique values) for this table.

  SOLUTION:
SELECT actor_id, director_id
FROM (
    SELECT 
        actor_id,
        director_id,
        COUNT(timestamp) AS cooperated
    FROM ActorDirector
    GROUP BY actor_id, director_id
) AS table1
WHERE cooperated >= 3;
